+The port took `tabindex="0"` always, so a radiogroup inside one was two stops. It now
+takes it only while nothing inside it is a tab stop (an element at `tabindex="-1"` is
+not one); focus on a control inside scrolls it into view. Nothing to change unless you call `.focus()` on a `FadingScroll` root that
+holds controls: it no longer takes focus then.
